{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfxJpHFiuaJPEQCrTCh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't pick anything. I'm leaning towards one of the \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" tracks, because that's what everyone at work talks about. But I'd come back on a computer first. Not sure at all. What made me stop is that the list never ends: it says \"143 מסלולים של 12 חברות\", and every company has the same track names.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Top of the page.** The heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and the \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" chip. That's exactly what I came for, so I stayed. The filter row is a wall of buttons (\"עוקב מדד s&p 500 12\", \"מניות 12\"...). I didn't press any.\n- **The table.** I tracked two columns, \"דמי ניהול ... מהחיסכון\" and \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\" (3 years / 5 years).\n- **The first S&P row I saw** (13414): 0.56%, \"13.7%\" for 3 years, 2.3 billion ₪. That's the number that stuck with me. Problem: I never saw which company that first group belongs to. The table starts straight away with no company name above it. Was that the bank? No idea.\n- **The groups with a name.** I noticed \"מור\", \"אנליסט\", \"מיטב\" and \"אלטשולר שחם\". Altshuler and Meitav I've heard of, so they feel safer. Mor and Analyst I don't know.\n- **Altshuler's S&P track** (14865) has the cheapest fee of the ones I saw, \"0.54%\". But where the return should be it just says \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", so there's nothing to compare with the 13.7%.\n- **The \"מניות\" tracks** show \"24.04%\" and \"26.39%\" for 3 years. My eye jumped to them and I nearly went for one of those. Then I didn't really get what makes them different from the S&P track.\n- **Screens 9 to 14.** I skipped them, my thumb just flew past. At the bottom there are new tracks with \"עוד לא דווח\" in orange with a warning icon. That scared me off them.\n\n**Words I didn't get:**\n- \"מט״ח\" with a percent next to it, like \"99% מט״ח\"\n- \"אשראי ואג״ח\"\n- \"הלכה\" (I guess it's the religious-friendly track?)\n- \"גמיש\"\n- the coloured rings (I guessed teal = shares, yellow = foreign currency)\n- \"נכסים\"\n- \"קופה\" with the number (15286, 8211...). What is that number?\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The top table has no company name. That's the most important thing and it's missing.\n- The fees are all 0.5–0.7%. To me that sounds like nothing, there's no amount in shekels, so I couldn't tell who's actually cheaper.\n- The yellow box \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\" made me wonder if the numbers are even right.\n- Around the fifth or sixth screen I was bored and would have closed it on the bus."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1935,"cache_read_input_tokens":19191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1935},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f052679d-1067-4991-93c0-b56daf275586","uuid":"8de4beb0-5f1f-4278-81cf-84412cd378b0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:27:04.134Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfxJbPg5hRL9p83g2DW"}
